        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Of course, recycling is not the only or even the best way to conserve: reducing consumption outright and reusing rather than disposing of materials whenever possible could have an even bigger impact, but they also demand more commitment. The challenge is to get the public to embrace these actions as they have already embraced recycling.",
